    "description": {
      "en": "Refill and pump adapters for soap / lotion / sanitizer dispensers, built around the real SPI 410 continuous-thread bottle-neck finishes — 20-410, 24-410, 28-410 (major Ø 20 / 24 / 28 mm, 8-TPI → 3.175 mm pitch). Threads are functional single-start helical ribs. Build a female pump collar, a 410-to-410 neck reducer, or a sealing travel cap.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Adaptadores de recarga y bomba para dispensadores de jabón / loción / gel, construidos alrededor de los acabados reales SPI 410 de rosca continua — 20-410, 24-410, 28-410 (Ø mayor 20 / 24 / 28 mm, 8-TPI → paso 3.175 mm). Las roscas son nervios helicoidales funcionales. Genera un collar de bomba hembra, un reductor de cuello 410-a-410, o una tapa de viaje selladora.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/pump-adapter.webp",
    "tags": ["soap", "dispenser", "pump", "bottle", "thread", "410", "refill", "household", "hyperobject", "commons"],
